  <event id="documentation_day">
    <title>The Docs Are a Desert</title>
    <text>New hires are struggling to onboard because almost nothing is documented. Someone proposes a quarterly "docs day" — no feature work, just writing.</text>
    <background></background>
    <left text="Dedicate a full day every quarter.">
      <effect attribute="wellbeing" value="8"/>
      <effect attribute="morale" value="10"/>
      <effect attribute="prosperity" value="-5"/>
      <effect attribute="codebase" value="15"/>
    </left>
    <right text="Docs happen organically. Back to coding.">
      <effect attribute="wellbeing" value="3"/>
      <effect attribute="morale" value="-8"/>
      <effect attribute="prosperity" value="8"/>
      <effect attribute="codebase" value="-10"/>
    </right>
  </event>

  <event id="monitoring_setup">
    <title>Observability Investment</title>
    <text>The ops team says without proper monitoring, the next incident will take days to diagnose. Setup takes a sprint. The roadmap is already packed.</text>
    <background></background>
